CHECK:UNNECESSARY_PARENTHESES: Unnecessary parentheses around 'typeReq == GetPortStatus'
#180: FILE: drivers/usb/host/ehci-brcm.c:72:
+	if ((typeReq == GetPortStatus) &&
+	    (wIndex && wIndex <= ports) &&
+	    ehci->reset_done[wIndex-1] &&
+	    time_after_eq(jiffies, ehci->reset_done[wIndex-1]) &&
+	    (ehci_readl(ehci, status_reg) & PORT_RESUME)) {

Parentheses are not required in the following cases:

  1. Function pointer uses::

      (foo->bar)();

    could be::

      foo->bar();

  2. Comparisons in if::

      if ((foo->bar) && (foo->baz))
      if ((foo == bar))

    could be::

      if (foo->bar && foo->baz)
      if (foo == bar)

  3. addressof/dereference single Lvalues::

      &(foo->bar)
      *(foo->bar)

    could be::

      &foo->bar
      *foo->bar

